  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br><br>Sea Turtle Retreat | An Opulent Gulf-Front Escape on 30A<br>Managed by Bonheur Vacations<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS<br><br>• 7 Bedrooms | 7 Full Bathrooms | 2 Half Bathrooms<br>• Sleeps 28<br>• Stunning Gulf Views<br>• Private Beach Access<br>• Private Heated Plunge Pool*<br>• 6-Seater Golf Cart + 6 Adult Bikes Included<br>• Balcony Fire Pit Overlooking the Gulf<br>• Gated Community<br>• Parking for 4 Vehicles<br><br>*Pool heating available October 1 – May 1 for $30 per day.<br><br>Where Coastal Grandeur Meets Elevated Living<br><br>Welcome to Sea Turtle Retreat, an extraordinary three-story luxury residence in the heart of Seagrove Beach along iconic 30A. Designed for those who seek both refinement and exhilaration, this opulent coastal estate blends modern sophistication with the effortless beauty of the Gulf.<br><br>Behind the gates of an exclusive community, you’ll discover sweeping emerald views, private beach access, curated designer interiors, and resort-style amenities crafted for unforgettable gatherings.<br><br>From sunrise coffee overlooking the Gulf to firelit evenings under the stars, every detail of this home invites you to indulge.<br><br>First Floor | Entertain & Unwind<br><br>The first level welcomes you with a spacious lounge featuring a wet bar complete with sink, ice maker, and mini fridge — ideal for poolside cocktails and relaxed evenings.<br><br>This level includes:<br>• King Guest Suite with private ensuite<br>• Expansive Bunk Suite (three queen-over-queen bunks, sleeps 12)<br>• Full Bath + Half Bath<br>• Large Laundry Room with Double Washers & Dryers<br>• Elevator Access<br>• Seamless access to the private plunge pool and outdoor living area<br><br>Designed for connection and comfort, this level is perfect for multi-generational gatherings.<br><br>Second Floor | Elevated Entertaining<br><br>The heart of the home unfolds on the second level, where panoramic Gulf views set the stage for unforgettable moments.<br><br>The open-concept living area features a fireplace and designer furnishings that flow effortlessly into the dining space (seating for 10, plus 6 at the island). The chef’s kitchen is a true showpiece, outfitted with:<br><br>• Wolf 6-burner range with double ovens<br>• Sub-Zero refrigeration<br>• Sub-Zero wine fridge<br>• Ice machine<br>• Double dishwashers<br>• Wet bar<br><br>Step onto the balcony to take in the Gulf breeze and shimmering horizon.<br><br>Two luxurious King Guest Suites with private ensuites and a stylish half bath complete this level.<br><br>Third Floor | Private Luxury & Gulf Serenity<br><br>The third floor elevates the experience with a private retreat atmosphere and breathtaking views.<br><br>Highlights include:<br>• Primary King Suite with spa-inspired ensuite (soaking tub, walk-in shower, dual vanities) and shared Gulf-view balcony<br>• King Guest Suite with ensuite and Gulf views<br>• Bunk Room (queen-over-queen + twin-over-twin) with private bath<br>• Wet bar with sink & mini fridge<br>• Additional washer & dryer<br>• Gulf-front balcony with fire pit — perfect for sunset gatherings<br><br>This level was designed for both tranquility and celebration.<br><br>Outdoor Oasis | Resort-Style Living<br><br>Step outside into your private coastal sanctuary.<br><br>• Heated plunge pool<br>• Outdoor grilling station with ice machine & mini fridge<br>• Al fresco dining with fire pit<br>• Outdoor shower<br>• Observation terrace with wet bar<br>• Green space<br>• Private beach access<br><br>Whether lounging poolside, cruising 30A in your included 6-seater golf cart, or biking to nearby beach towns, every day offers new adventure.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements (Sleeps 28)<br><br>First Floor (Sleeps 14)<br>• King Suite (2)<br>• Bunk Suite – Three Queen-over-Queen Bunks (12)<br><br>Second Floor (Sleeps 4)<br>• King Guest Suite (2)<br>• King Guest Suite (2)<br><br>Third Floor (Sleeps 10)<br>• Primary King Suite (2)<br>• King Guest Suite (2)<br>• Bunk Room – Queen-over-Queen + Twin-over-Twin (6)<br><br>Sea Turtle Retreat is more than a vacation home — it is a statement of coastal luxury, thoughtfully designed for extraordinary experiences along 30A.<br><br>From curated interiors to Gulf-front sunsets and private beach access, every moment here is elevated.<br><br>Bonheur Vacations is the ultimate vacation manager for your epic and luxurious 30A vacation.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Sea Turtle Retreat An Opulent Beach Escape on 30A"
        }
      ],
